          "name": "SMF119LEN",
          "length": "2",
          "format": "binary",
          "description": "Record length. This field and the next field (total of four bytes) form the RDW (record descriptor word). See \u201cStandard SMF Record Header\u201d on page 13-1 for a detailed description.",
          "reserved": false
